* TLC2262 rail-to-rail-output CMOS dual op-amp, ±8 V max (our model from TI's sheet)
* Built by Solum Builder from TI TLC226x data sheet SLOS177D (March 2001), TLC2262C at VDD± = ±5 V (D-162)
.subckt TLC2262 1 2 3 4 5
* pins: + - V+ V- out. Built by Solum Builder from the sheet's typical figures (D-162)
Rin 1 2 1e+12
Rc1 1 mid 1e12
Rc2 2 mid 1e12
Emid mid 4 3 4 0.5
Bgm mid g I=1e-05*tanh(9.94371*(V(1)-V(2)))
R1 g mid 2.01132e+09
C1 g mid 1.81818e-11
Vhp 3 hp DC 0.04
Vhn hn 4 DC 0
Dhi g hp DCLAMP
Dlo hn g DCLAMP
Ebuf b 0 g 0 1
Rp b p 1000
Cp p 0 1.41584e-10
Eout o 0 p 0 1
Vsense o o2 0
Rout o2 5 200
Bsrc 3 0 I=max(i(Vsense),0)
Bsnk 0 4 I=max(-i(Vsense),0)
Iq 3 4 DC 0.0002125
.model DCLAMP D(is=1e-15 n=0.05)
.ends
